@baseUrl = http://localhost:5187

### Alkalmazás
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Alapár: Ducati, 1.5 óra → 27000 HUF
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/wage-calculation/ducati?workHours=1.5

### Case-insensitive márka
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/wage-calculation/DUCATI?workHours=1.5

### A kerekítés látható: Suzuki, 0.00001 óra → 1 HUF
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/wage-calculation/suzuki?workHours=0.00001

### Ismeretlen márka → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/wage-calculation/bmw?workHours=1.5

### Érvénytelen munkaóra → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/wage-calculation/ducati?workHours=0

### Query binding hiba → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/wage-calculation/ducati?workHours=abc

### Hiányzó márkaszegmens → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/wage-calculation?workHours=1.5
